	// mixing and the `echo` type). Only sessions that announced E2EE support (`E2eeHello`) may join
	// (`E2EE_REQUIRED`); a WebRTC session cannot mix encrypted and plaintext channels
	// (`E2EE_MIXED_CHANNELS`). Disclosed as `ChannelJoinAck.audio.e2ee`.
